  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conquer Mt. Kili to Challenge Menstrual Taboos</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We believe that every woman and girl deserve to live a life free from the challenges and limitations imposed by menstruation. Still, for many women around the world access to menstrual health products, education/information, supportive facilities and professional support remains a significant barrier.   To address this issue head-on we are embarking on an extraordinary journey that combines adventures and advocacy: the Kilimanjaro Climb.</narrative>
  </description>
